msgid "s"
msgstr "s"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1092
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesSLA.cpp:281
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/FdmViewerWrapper.cpp:1017
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Kleur"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1100
msgid ""
"Leave unused if the filament profile isn't tied to a specific color. Color "
"can still be set at project-level."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1107
msgid "Filament notes"
msgstr "Filamentopmerkingen"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1112
msgid "You can put your notes regarding the filament here."
msgstr "Hier kunt u opmerkingen over het filament plaatsen."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1120
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:2598
msgid "Max volumetric speed"
msgstr "Maximale volumetrische snelheid"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1124
msgid ""
"Maximum volumetric speed allowed for this filament. Limits the maximum "
"volumetric speed of a print to the minimum of print and filament volumetric "
"speed. Set to zero for no limit."
msgstr ""
"Maximale volumetrische snelheid is toegestaan voor dit filament. Dit beperkt "
"de maximale volumetrische snelheid van een print tot het minimum van de "
"maximale volumetrische snelheid van de print en het filament. Als dit "
"ingesteld is op 0, geldt er geen limiet."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1127
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1376
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:2605
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Units.cpp:46
#: src/slic3r-shared-wx/src/Slic3r/App/WX/RammingChart.cpp:145
msgid "mm³/s"
msgstr "mm³/s"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1133
msgid "Max non-crossing infill speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1138
msgid ""
"Maximum speed allowed for this filament while printing infill without any "
"self intersections in a single layer. Set to zero for no limit."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1147
msgid "Max crossing infill speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1152
msgid ""
"Maximum speed allowed for this filament while printing infill with self "
"intersections in a single layer. Set to zero for no limit."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1161
msgid "Loading speed"
msgstr "Laadsnelheid"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1166
msgid "Speed used for loading the filament on the wipe tower."
msgstr "Snelheid die gebruikt wordt voor het afveegblok."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1173
msgid "Loading speed at the start"
msgstr "Laadsnelheid aan het begin"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1178
msgid "Speed used at the very beginning of loading phase."
msgstr "Snelheid die gebruikt wordt aan het begin van de laadfase."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1185
msgid "Unloading speed"
msgstr "Ontlaadsnelheid"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1190
msgid ""
"Speed used for unloading the filament on the wipe tower (does not affect  "
"initial part of unloading just after ramming)."
msgstr ""
"Snelheid die gebruikt wordt voor het ontladen van het afveegblok (heeft geen "
"effect op het initiële onderdeel van het ontladen direct na de ramming)."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1198
msgid "Unloading speed at the start"
msgstr "Ontlaadsnelheid in het begin"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1203
msgid ""
"Speed used for unloading the tip of the filament immediately after ramming."
msgstr ""
"Snelheid die gebruikt wordt voor het ontladen van het filament direct na de "
"ramming."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1210
msgid "Delay after unloading"
msgstr "Vertraging na het ontladen"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1215
msgid ""
"Time to wait after the filament is unloaded. May help to get reliable "
"toolchanges with flexible materials that may need more time to shrink to "
"original dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Wachttijd voor het ontladen van het filament. Dit kan helpen om betrouwbare "
"toolwisselingen te krijgen met flexibele materialen die meer tijd nodig "
"hebben om te krimpen naar de originele afmetingen."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1224
msgid "Stamping loading speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1229
msgid "Speed used for stamping."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1236
msgid "Stamping distance measured from the center of the cooling tube"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1241
msgid ""
"If set to nonzero value, filament is moved toward the nozzle between the "
"individual cooling moves (\"stamping\"). This option configures how long "
"this movement should be before the filament is retracted again."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1249
msgid "Number of cooling moves"
msgstr "Aantal koelbewegingen"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1254
msgid ""
"Filament is cooled by being moved back and forth in the cooling tubes. "
"Specify desired number of these moves."
msgstr ""
"Het filament wordt gekoeld tijdens het terug en voorwaarts bewegen in de "
"koelbuis. Specificeer het benodigd aantal bewegingen."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1262
msgid "Speed of the first cooling move"
msgstr "Snelheid voor de eerste koelbeweging"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1267
msgid "Cooling moves are gradually accelerating beginning at this speed."
msgstr ""
"Koelbewegingen worden gelijkmatig versneld, beginnend vanaf deze snelheid."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1274
msgid "Minimal purge on wipe tower"
msgstr "Minimale afstand op afveegblok"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1279
msgid ""
"After a tool change, the exact position of the newly loaded filament inside "
"the nozzle may not be known, and the filament pressure is likely not yet "
"stable. Before purging the print head into an infill or a sacrificial "
"object, Slic3r will always prime this amount of material into the wipe tower "
"to produce successive infill or sacrificial object extrusions reliably."
msgstr ""
"Na een toolwissel is de exacte locatie van het geladen filament onbekend en "
"zal de druk op het filament niet stabiel zijn. Voor het afvegen van de "
"printkop in de vulling zal PrusaSlicer eerst deze hoeveelheid materiaal "
"afvegen aan het afveegblok om vervolgens de vulling of overige objecten goed "
"te kunnen printen."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1283
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1364
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:2779
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Units.cpp:45
msgid "mm³"
msgstr "mm³"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1289
msgid "Speed of the last cooling move"
msgstr "Snelheid voor de laatste koelbeweging"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1294
msgid "Cooling moves are gradually accelerating towards this speed."
msgstr "Koelbewegingen versnellen gelijkmatig tot aan deze snelheid."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1301
msgid "Purge volume multiplier"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1306
msgid ""
"Purging volume on the wipe tower is determined by 'multimaterial_purging' in "
"Printer Settings. This option allows to modify the volume on filament level. "
"Note that the project can override this by setting project-specific values."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1315
msgid "Ramming parameters"
msgstr "Rammingparameters"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1320
msgid ""
"This string is edited by RammingDialog and contains ramming specific "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Deze frase is bewerkt door het Rammingdialoog en bevat parameters voor de "
"ramming."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1326
msgid "Ramming temperature variation"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1330
msgid ""
"Temperature difference to be applied right before ramming. The value can be "
"negative."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1336
msgid "Pause before ramming"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1341
msgid ""
"Time in seconds that the printer will remain idle before ramming, allowing "
"the melt zone temperature to equalize."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1346
msgid "Enable ramming for multitool setups"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1351
msgid ""
"Perform ramming when using multitool printer (i.e. when the 'Single Extruder "
"Multimaterial' in Printer Settings is unchecked). When checked, a small "
"amount of filament is rapidly extruded on the wipe tower just before the "
"toolchange. This option is only used when the wipe tower is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1358
msgid "Multitool ramming volume"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1363
msgid "The volume to be rammed before the toolchange."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1370
msgid "Multitool ramming flow"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1375
msgid "Flow used for ramming the filament before the toolchange."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1382
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Plater/MeasureDialog.cpp:158
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Config/BedShape.cpp:63
msgid "Diameter"
msgstr "Diameter"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1387
msgid ""
"Enter your filament diameter here. Good precision is required, so use a "
"caliper and do multiple measurements along the filament, then compute the "
"average."
msgstr ""
"Stel hier de filamentdiameter in. De juiste precisie is benodigd. Gebruik "
"daarom een schuifmaat en doe meerdere metingen over het hele filament. "
"Bereken vervolgens het gemiddelde."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1395
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesSLA.cpp:338
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesSLA.cpp:342
msgid "Density"
msgstr "Dichtheid"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1400
msgid ""
"Enter your filament density here. This is only for statistical information. "
"A decent way is to weigh a known length of filament and compute the ratio of "
"the length to volume. Better is to calculate the volume directly through "
"displacement."
msgstr ""
"Stel hier de dichtheid van het filament in. Dit is slechts voor de "
"statistieken. Formule voor dichtheid: dichtheid[g/cm³] = massa[g] / "
"volume[cm³]. Formule voor volume: volume[cm³] = 1000 * (diameter[mm])² * π / "
"4 * lengte[mm]."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1403
msgid "g/cm³"
msgstr "g/cm³"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1409
msgid "Filament type"
msgstr "Filamenttype"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1414
msgid "The filament material type for use in custom G-codes."
msgstr "Het filamenttype voor het gebruik van de custom G-codes."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1442
msgid "Soluble material"
msgstr "Oplosbaar materiaal"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1447
msgid "Soluble material is most likely used for a soluble support."
msgstr "Oplosbaar materiaal wordt vaak gebruikt voor oplosbaar support."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1452
msgid "Abrasive material"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1457
msgid ""
"This flag means that the material is abrasive and requires a hardened "
"nozzle. The value is used by the printer to check it."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1462
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesSLA.cpp:349
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesSLA.cpp:353
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/ObjectListWindow.cpp:105
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "Kosten"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1467
msgid ""
"Enter your filament cost per kg here. This is only for statistical "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Voer hier de filamentkosten per kilogram in. Dit is alleen voor statistische "
"informatie."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1468
msgid "money/kg"
msgstr "€/kg"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1474
msgid "Spool weight"
msgstr "Spoelgewicht"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1479
msgid ""
"Enter weight of the empty filament spool. One may weigh a partially consumed "
"filament spool before printing and one may compare the measured weight with "
"the calculated weight of the filament with the spool to find out whether the "
"amount of filament on the spool is sufficient to finish the print."
msgstr ""
"Voer het gewicht van een lege filamentspoel in. Je kunt een halfvolle "
"filamentspoel wegen voor het printen en gemeten gewicht vergelijken met het "
"berekende gewicht van de filamentspoel om te weten te komen of de "
"hoeveelheid filament op de spoel voldoende is om de print te voltooien."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1483
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Units.cpp:34
msgid "g"
msgstr "g"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1496
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesSLA.cpp:496
msgid "(Unknown)"
msgstr "(Onbekend)"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1504
msgid "Shrinkage compensation XY"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1505
msgid ""
"Enter your filament shrinkage percentages for the X and Y axes here to apply "
"scaling of the object to compensate for shrinkage in the X and Y axes. For "
"example, if you measured 99mm instead of 100mm, enter 1%."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1519
msgid "Shrinkage compensation Z"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1520
msgid ""
"Enter your filament shrinkage percentages for the Z axis here to apply "
"scaling of the object to compensate for shrinkage in the Z axis. For "
"example, if you measured 99mm instead of 100mm, enter 1%."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1531
msgid "Fill angle"
msgstr "Vullingshoek"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1536
msgid ""
"Default base angle for infill orientation. Cross-hatching will be applied to "
"this. Bridges will be infilled using the best direction Slic3r can detect, "
"so this setting does not affect them."
msgstr ""
"Standaard basishoek voor de vullingsrichting. Hier wordt kruislings overheen "
"geprint. Bruggen worden geprint met de optimale richting. Deze instelling "
"zal die richting niet beïnvloeden."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1548
msgid "Fill density"
msgstr "Vullingsdichtheid"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1553
msgid "Density of internal infill, expressed in the range 0% - 100%."
msgstr ""
"Dichtheid van inwendige vulling, uitgedrukt in een percentage (0 - 100%)"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1578
msgid "Fill pattern"
msgstr "Vullingspatroon"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1583
msgid "Fill pattern for general low-density infill."
msgstr "Vulpatroon voor algemene lagere-dichtheidsvulling."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1588
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:4102
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "Raster"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1589
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Plater/SimplifyDialog.cpp:38
msgid "Triangles"
msgstr "Facetten"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1590
msgid "Stars"
msgstr "Sterren"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1591
msgid "Cubic"
msgstr "Kubisch"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1592
msgid "Line"
msgstr "Lijn"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1594
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:4038
msgid "Honeycomb"
msgstr "Honingraat"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1595
msgid "3D Honeycomb"
msgstr "3D-honingraat"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1596
msgid "Gyroid"
msgstr "Gyroïde"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1600
msgid "Adaptive Cubic"
msgstr "Adaptief kubisch"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1601
msgid "Support Cubic"
msgstr "Ondersteunend kubisch"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1602
msgid "Lightning"
msgstr "Bliksem"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1603
msgid "Zig Zag"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1609
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1652
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDef.cpp:154
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/ObjectListWindow.cpp:107
msgid "First layer"
msgstr "Eerste laag"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1614
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for first layer. Set zero to "
"disable acceleration control for first layer."
msgstr ""
"Deze acceleratie zal uw printer gebruiken voor de eerste laag. Als dit "
"ingesteld is op 0, wordt de standaard acceleratie gebruikt."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1623
msgid "First object layer over raft interface"
msgstr "Eerste laag van het object boven de raft-interface"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1628
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for first layer of object "
"above raft interface. Set zero to disable acceleration control for first "
"layer of object above raft interface."
msgstr ""
"Dit is de acceleratie die uw printer gebruikt voor de eerste laag boven de "
"raft-interface. Stel in op 0 om acceleratiecontrole uit te schakelen voor de "
"eerste laag boven de raft-interface."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1636
msgid "Bed First layer"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1641
msgid "First layer bed temperature"
msgstr "Bedtemperatuur eerste laag"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1642
msgid ""
"Heated build plate temperature for the first layer. Set this to zero to "
"disable bed temperature control commands in the output."
msgstr ""
"Bedtemperatuur voor de eerste laag. Als dit ingesteld is op 0, worden "
"bedtemperatuur-commando's weggelaten in de output."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1657
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for first "
"layer. You can use this to force fatter extrudates for better adhesion. If "
"expressed as percentage (for example 120%) it will be computed over "
"nozzle_diameter. If set to zero, it will use the default extrusion width."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1668
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Preset/AbstractConfigManipulation.cpp:68
msgid "First layer height"
msgstr "Laagdikte eerste laag"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1673
msgid ""
"When printing with very low layer heights, you might still want to print a "
"thicker bottom layer to improve adhesion and tolerance for non perfect build "
"plates."
msgstr ""
"Tijdens het printen van zeer dunne lagen kunt u een dikkere bodemlaag "
"printen om bedhechting en tolerantie te verbeteren op niet-perfecte "
"printbedden."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1682
msgid "First layer speed"
msgstr "Snelheid eerste laag"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1687
msgid ""
"If expressed as absolute value in mm/s, this speed will be applied to all "
"the print moves of the first layer, regardless of their type. If expressed "
"as a percentage (for example: 40%) it will scale the default speeds."
msgstr ""
"Als dit uitgedrukt wordt als absolute waarde (in mm/s), zal deze snelheid "
"toegepast worden bij alle printbewegingen van de eerste laag, onafhankelijk "
"van het type. Als dit is uitgedrukt als percentage, wordt dit berekend over "
"de standaardsnelheid."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1698
msgid "First layer solid infill speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1703
msgid ""
"If expressed as absolute value in mm/s, this speed will be applied to the "
"solid infill print moves of the first layer. If expressed as a percentage "
"(for example: 40%) it will be a percantage of the solid infill speed (for "
"example: 40% of the solid infill speed). Note that 0 means that the \"First "
"layer speed\" value will be used."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1715
msgid "Speed of object first layer over raft interface"
msgstr "Snelheid van de eerste laag boven de raft-interface"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1720
msgid ""
"If expressed as absolute value in mm/s, this speed will be applied to all "
"the print moves of the first object layer above raft interface, regardless "
"of their type. If expressed as a percentage (for example: 40%) it will scale "
"the default speeds."
msgstr ""
"Als dit is uitgedrukt als absolute waarde in mm/s wordt de snelheid "
"toegepast voor alle printbewegingen van de eerste laag boven een raft-"
"interface, onafhankelijk van het type. Als dit is uitgedrukt als percentage "
"(bijv. 40%) worden de standaard snelheden verschaald."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1729
msgid "Nozzle First layer"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1734
msgid "First layer nozzle temperature"
msgstr "Nozzletemperatuur eerste laag"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1735
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature for the first layer. If you want to control temperature "
"manually during print, set this to zero to disable temperature control "
"commands in the output G-code."
msgstr ""
"Nozzletemperatuur voor de eerste laag. Als je handmatig de temperatuur wilt "
"wijzigen in de print, stel dit dan in op 0 om temperatuurregeling uit te "
"zetten in de G-code."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1744
msgid "Full fan speed at layer"
msgstr "Volledige ventilatorsnelheid op laag"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1749
msgid ""
"Fan speed will be ramped up linearly from zero at layer "
"\"disable_fan_first_layers\" to maximum at layer \"full_fan_speed_layer\". "
"\"full_fan_speed_layer\" will be ignored if lower than "
"\"disable_fan_first_layers\", in which case the fan will be running at "
"maximum allowed speed at layer \"disable_fan_first_layers\" + 1."
msgstr ""
"De ventilatorsnelheid wordt geleidelijk opgebouwd van 0 op laag "
"\"disable_fan_first_layers\" naar het maximale op laag \"full_fan_speed_layer"
"\". \"full_fan_speed_layer\" wordt genegeerd als die lager is dan "
"\"disable_fan_first_layers\" in welk geval de ventilator zal draaien op de "
"maximaal toegestane snelheid op laag \"disable_fan_first_layers\" + 1."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1760
msgid "Fuzzy Skin"
msgstr "Oneffen oppervlak"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1765
msgid "Fuzzy skin type."
msgstr "Type oneffen oppervlak."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1768
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigPhysical.cpp:95
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Config/ConfigItemFilePicker.cpp:107
msgid "None"
msgstr "Geen"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1769
msgid "Outside walls"
msgstr "Alleen buitenwanden"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1770
msgid "All walls"
msgstr "Alle wanden"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1776
msgid "Fuzzy skin thickness"
msgstr "Dikte van oneffen oppervlak"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1781
msgid ""
"The maximum distance that each skin point can be offset (both ways), "
"measured perpendicular to the perimeter wall."
msgstr ""
"De maximale afstand die elke punt kan hebben (naar beide kanten), haaks "
"gemeten op de perimeterwand."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1790
msgid "Fuzzy skin point distance"
msgstr "Puntafstand van oneffen oppervlak"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1795
msgid ""
"Perimeters will be split into multiple segments by inserting Fuzzy skin "
"points. Lowering the Fuzzy skin point distance will increase the number of "
"randomly offset points on the perimeter wall."
msgstr ""
"Perimeters worden gesplitst in meerdere segmenten bij het toevoegen van "
"punten voor oneffen oppervlak. Verlagen van de afstand zorgt voor een "
"verhoging van het aantal willekeurige punten op de perimeterwand."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1804
msgid "Fill gaps"
msgstr "Vul gaten"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1809
msgid ""
"Enables filling of gaps between perimeters and between the inner most "
"perimeters and infill."
msgstr ""
"Toestaan van het vullen van gaten tussen perimeters en de binnenste "
"perimeter en vulling."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1820
msgid ""
"Speed for filling small gaps using short zigzag moves. Keep this reasonably "
"low to avoid too much shaking and resonance issues. Set zero to disable gaps "
"filling."
msgstr ""
"Printsnelheid voor het gatvullen waarbij zigzag-bewegingen worden gebruikt. "
"Houd deze waarde laag om schudden te voorkomen (wat resulteert in "
"resonantieproblemen). Als dit is ingesteld op 0, worden gaten niet gevuld."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1832
msgid "Verbose G-code"
msgstr "Opmerkingen in G-code"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1833
msgid ""
"Enable this to get a commented G-code file, with each line explained by a "
"descriptive text. If you print from SD card, the additional weight of the "
"file could make your firmware slow down."
msgstr ""
"Sta dit toe om een G-code met opmerkingen te genereren. Bij elk blok "
"commando's wordt een opmerking geplaatst. Als u print vanaf een SD-kaart, "
"kan de extra grootte van het bestand de firmware vertragen."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1844
msgid "G-code flavor"
msgstr "G-code-variant"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1845
msgid ""
"Some G/M-code commands, including temperature control and others, are not "
"universal. Set this option to your printer's firmware to get a compatible "
"output. The \"No extrusion\" flavor prevents PrusaSlicer from exporting any "
"extrusion value at all."
msgstr ""
"Sommige G- en M-commando's zijn niet universeel. Stel deze optie in om een "
"compatibele uitvoer te krijgen voor uw printer. De 'Geen extrusie'-"
"instelling kan gebruikt worden om te printen zonder materiaal te extruderen."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1850
msgid "RepRap/Sprinter"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1851
msgid "RepRapFirmware"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1852
msgid "Repetier"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1853
msgid "Teacup"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1854
msgid "MakerWare (MakerBot)"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1855
msgid "Marlin (legacy)"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1856
msgid "Marlin 2"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1857
msgid "Prusa Firmware (Buddy)"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1858
msgid "Klipper"
msgstr ""

